### =====================================================
### MEMBER MODULE - SMOKE TEST
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@memberId = 1

#########################################################
### MEMBER
#########################################################

### 1. Xem hồ sơ
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

###

### 2. Cập nhật hồ sơ
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01",
  "address": "Đà Nẵng",
  "emergencyContactName": "Nguyễn Văn B",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "0912345678",
  "fitnessGoal": "LOSE_WEIGHT",
  "healthNote": "Không"
}

###

### 3. Upload Avatar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FitLife

--FitLife
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./files/avatar.jpg
--FitLife--

###

### 4. Timeline của tôi
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/me/timeline?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

#########################################################
### ADMIN
#########################################################

###

### 5. Danh sách Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/members?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 6. Chi tiết Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/members/{{memberId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 7. Timeline Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/members/{{memberId}}/timeline?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}